# The four platform repos are separate Git repositories nested in this workspace (ADR-001).
/warden-infra/
/warden-gitops/
/warden-policy/
/warden-platform/
# Generated service repos, if cloned here for local work.
/svc-*/

# Python
.venv/
__pycache__/
*.pyc

# Local presentation build dependencies
/scripts/node_modules/

# Local secrets and kubeconfigs — never commit
.env
*.pem
*.key
kubeconfig*
.warden/

# Large recordings (link them instead)
evidence/recordings/*.mp4
evidence/recordings/*.mkv

# OS / editors
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
.idea/
.vscode/*
!.vscode/extensions.json

# Throwaway spike repos (each is its own Git repo)
/warden-spike-*/
